OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 82, jailed for raping girls
OL,4,Ain 1960s and 70s
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 82-year-old man convicted of raping
OL,7,Fand sexually abusing three girls in the
OL,8,F1960s and 1970s has been jailed for 19
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FDavid Fisher, from Thatcham, started
OL,12,Fabusing his victims when they were aged
OL,13,F10 and 11, and was only reported after
OL,14,Fone saw him on a bus decades later.
OL,16,FFisher, who worked for the former
OL,17,FBerkshire County Council at the time,
OL,18,Fpersuaded the girls to get into his car
OL,19,Fand abused them in woods across West
OL,20,FBerkshire.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
